리소스 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4dc5255b-acc1-44c4-92d5-ae16ab613528\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-434588c0-e5ad-415b-be38-a1c165f4ed80\">※ 업데이트 후 에러 메시지 팝업이 반복적으로 표시될 경우, 게임을 완전히 종료하신 후 재접속하여 업데이트 리소스를 다운로드 해주시길 바랍니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-dab2db40-be01-4585-9d34-12258195188c\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b6aee3a6-5ec3-4e84-8e87-9838decf84e5\">​※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-491d57f3-13bd-479e-8e22-c3966032c11d\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-49026675-4a10-4fd0-b846-84cd08153140\">·····················································································​​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9e21c8e7-bcad-4eae-8036-9e8c50aa3f89\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e12b69f9-773c-4697-8d82-68ca7bc5b756\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e4e49eb1-2411-47b6-951b-0e743488710f\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5fe52759-98ed-4cd4-9e44-7b409b14e246\">게임 이용에 불편을 드린 점 깊이 사과드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_text\", \"id\": \"SE-824921bd-1343-4f95-b126-bbb0ca97e271\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"text\"  }}'></script>\n             